                        "review": "This game is good but it's more of arcade type in terms of handling rather than simulation type which we get in tt isle of man 3, Ride 4 and MotoGP games\nThe gameplay and graphics are good but little outdated. The overall content in this game is very wide/huge which provides us lot of choices for bikes and tracks selection. And one important thing which i really liked about this game is it has lot of open Road Side Style Racing Tracks where u can enjoy environment, mountains, rivers, landscape sceneries and roads side nature while racing which we can't enjoy in specifically designed traditional circuit tracks for racing and newer entries of Ride game series like Ride 5 and Ride 6 focuses more on circuit tracks racing rather than focusing more on road side racing, which i think I don't like because MotoGP games are already available with such large circuit tracks & with officially licenced contents etc. And i think that Milestone forgets that only due to it's open road style type racings Ride series becomes so popular and enjoyable, So its a must try game and Ride series are actually Forza Horizon of Bikes👍",
